{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19054","headline":"酬李相公喜归乡国自巩县夜泛洛水见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬李相公喜归乡国自巩县夜泛洛水见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巩树烟月上，清光含碧流。\n且无三已色，犹泛五湖州。\n鹏息风还起，凤归林正秋。\n虽攀小山桂，此地不淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19054.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19054","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}